# Frontend

## Stack

- **Templates**: `src/main/resources/templates/` (Thymeleaf)
- **CSS**: Tailwind v4 — source at `src/main/frontend/styles/input.css`, output to `src/main/resources/static/css/app.css`
- **HTMX**: loaded from CDN in page `<head>`; use for partial page updates

## Tailwind

```bash
npm run watch:css   # dev — rebuild on change
npm run build:css   # prod — minified output
```

Run `npm run dev` for local hot reload (CSS + Kotlin + Spring Boot). Or manually: `watch:css` + `compileKotlin --continuous` + `bootRun`.

## HTMX patterns

- Return HTML fragments from dedicated endpoints; swap with `hx-get`, `hx-target`, `hx-swap`
- Keep fragments in `templates/fragments/`
- Use `th:fragment` for reusable pieces

## Styling

- Dark-first UI (slate palette); utility classes only — no custom CSS unless necessary
- Mobile-responsive by default (`max-w-*`, `px-*`, flex/grid)
